Quattro — the rally car

The car is cut from a wallpaper Omarchy ships with its tokyo-night theme,
`themes/tokyo-night/backgrounds/1-quattro.jpg`, and freed from its
background for use as a pet. Omarchy is MIT-licensed and that licence
carries no separate terms for its images:

  Copyright (c) David Heinemeier Hansson
  https://github.com/basecamp/omarchy — MIT

Which makes it as free to pass on as the rest of this repository, on the
same terms. The marks visible on the car belong to their owners and are
in the picture because they were in the wallpaper; nothing here is
endorsed by any of them.

The `pet.json` beside it, and the theming window it names, are the
plugin's own work under its MIT licence.
